The correspondence is not merely aesthetic. \text{{\igfont 𐑟}} (non-Abelian braiding) genuinely corresponds to
$\mathbf{b}$: the winding number is `\texttt{both} $+n$ and $-n$'' in the sense that the order of braiding operations
